# 10. Search for Partial Solutions

A project does NOT need to provide the complete Waqti solution to be useful.

A project that solves only:

* expert streaming
* GPU kernels
* KV cache
* quantization
* direct I/O
* model loading
* Vulkan execution
* NPU execution
* memory management
* Android JNI
* transformer kernels

