# 12. Build Multiple Backends

Do not assume there will be one universal execution backend.

Design Waqti around:

```text
             Waqti Runtime
                   │
        ┌──────────┼───────────┐
        ▼          ▼           ▼
       CPU        GPU         NPU
        │          │           │
      NEON       Vulkan     Vendor API
```

Then allow hybrid execution.

Example:

```text
CPU:
routing
control
unsupported operators

GPU:
large matrix operations

NPU:
supported AI operators

UFS:
expert storage
```

The runtime should decide dynamically.

