# 14. Implement a Fallback Ladder

Every important capability should have fallbacks.

Example:

```text
Best:
NPU

↓ if unavailable

GPU

↓ if unsupported

CPU NEON

↓ if optimized kernel unavailable

Generic CPU

↓ if still unsupported

Experimental implementation
```

Waqti should degrade gracefully instead of completely failing because one accelerator is unavailable.

